DESCRIPTION:Cover DataFrames, Series, groupby, merge/join, filtering, and indexing. Solve 2 practice questions.\n\nTopics:\n- DataFrame and Series creation\n- Indexing and slicing\n- groupby() for aggregation\n- merge() and join() for combining DataFrames\n- Filtering and boolean indexing\n\nPractice Problems:\n1. GroupBy Revenue Analysis\n2. Merge Customers with Orders\n\nResources:\n- Pandas User Guide\n- Pandas Cookbook\n- Kaggle Pandas Micro-Course
